as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="120" y="34" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="er-legend-t0" value="solid half-line = must be (mandatory at that end)" style="text;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="er-legend"><mxGeometry x="140" y="24" width="1000" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="er-legend-s1" value="" style="endArrow=none;dashed=1;html=1;" edge="1" parent="er-legend"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="20" y="68" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="120" y="68" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="er-legend-t1" value="dashed half-line = may be (optional at that end)" style="text;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="er-legend"><mxGeometry x="140" y="58" width="1000" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="er-legend-s2" value="" style="endArrow=ERmany;dashed=0;html=1;" edge="1" parent="er-legend"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="20" y="102" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="120" y="102" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="er-legend-t2" value="crow's foot (ERmany) = one or more; plain end = one and only one" style="text;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="er-legend"><mxGeometry x="140" y="92" width="1000" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="er-legend-s3" value="" style="endArrow=ERoneToMany;dashed=0;html=1;" edge="1" parent="er-legend"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="20" y="136" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="120" y="136" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="er-legend-t3" value="ERoneToMany = UID bar: relationship is part of the child's unique identifier" style="text;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="er-legend"><mxGeometry x="140" y="126" width="1000" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="er-legend-attr" value="Attributes: # = UID (primary identifier) · * = mandatory · o = optional. FK columns are drawn as relationships, sync columns (hlc, hlc_device, deleted) omitted. Grey = local-only (never synced). Each relationship = two half-lines meeting at an invisible junction; role names read from the near entity. [..] on a parent end = a must the schema does not enforce (rule owner)." style="text;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="er-legend"><mxGeometry x="20" y="170" width="1140" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="er-currency-note" value="CURRENCY relationships (not drawn, for legibility): each ACCOUNT, BUDGET LINE, ENTRY SHARE, FX RATE, HOUSEHOLD, IMPORT BUDGET ROW, IMPORT ROW, POSTING, RECURRING RULE, RECURRING RULE POSTING, RECURRING RULE SHARE, RULE CONDITION, SAVINGS GOAL must be (or, where the column is nullable, may be) denominated in one and only one CURRENCY; FX RATE has two (quoted from / quoted into); HOUSEHOLD must be reported in one CURRENCY. Each CURRENCY may be the denomination of one or more of each." style="text;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="171" width="300" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="er-provenance" value="Provenance: docs/db-review/design/schema.sql + schema-planned.sql + design.md rev. 3 (target, not yet migrated; planned tables marked). Relationships derived from declared FKs (PRAGMA foreign_key_list); optionality at the child end from NOT NULL; parent-end musts from design §8 rules. Inferred/open: 1:1 JOURNAL ENTRY–INSTALLMENT PLAN (A-04/Q-06); composite FKs (account_id, currency_code) and (reconciliation_id, account_id) drawn once on their leading column; CURRENCY relationships summarized in a note. Source notation: SQL DDL (no glyph translation)." style="text;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1260" y="2200" width="760" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>